@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] frame-lint-diagnostics
Lint MUST check the Frame folder with the Viz declarations and report source file, line and column
diagnostics. The standard layout reserves functions/ and databases/ for backend code and excludes
them from UI linting. Type errors, lint errors and missing tooling MUST fail the command.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] frame-lint-project-files
The script MUST NOT modify or execute Frame source or replace existing project configs. It MUST
lint the current source with its standard configs, even when the project has its own configs.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:performance] frame-lint-local-files
The checker files MUST be cached on local sandbox disk after first use. Generated lint configs
MUST stay on local disk and MUST be removed when the lint command exits.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:security] frame-types-verified-cache
Downloaded archives MUST match the manifest checksum and size before extraction. A cache entry
MUST become visible only after extraction succeeds. A changed manifest id MUST select new types.
